/api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/milestones/7/labels","id":453043,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNDUzMDQz","number":7,"title":"3.0.0","description":"New major release that breaks compatibility with 2.x\r\n\r\n- PHP5.4.19+\r\n- New ORM & behaviors.\r\n- Improved Routing\r\n- PSR-0 and composer support.\r\n- Simpler configuration and bootstrapping.\r\n- Improved configuration handling.\r\n- Improved bake.\r\n\r\nSee [the roadmap](http://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/wiki/3.0-roadmap) for more details.","creator":null,"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":2464,"state":"closed","created_at":"2013-10-11T20:56:23Z","updated_at":"2015-12-17T03:00:48Z","due_on":"2015-03-22T04:00:00Z","closed_at":"2015-03-23T01:02:41Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2014-07-17T00:40:15Z","updated_at":"2014-09-19T14:09:17Z","closed_at":"2014-07-18T13:28:25Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"When baking a view using `cake bake view modelname` the $keyFields variable in the ViewTask is being populated with the BelongsTo associations for the add//edit forms. That is then passed to the views as a variable.\n\nHowever, the appropriate variables are not being set when a controller is being baked for the add//edit methods.\n\nFor instance if you have a users model and it's associated with a groups model. The options index of the group_id field is getting a variable of $groups but the $groups variable is not being set in the add//edit methods of the controller.\n\nOn the contrary, when you bake using `cake bake all` this behavior is not happening. The $keyFields variable in the _loadController method is not being set.\n","closed_by":{"login":"markstory","id":24086,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/use